 The toPrettyJson method converts the collection into a pretty-printed JSON string. Uses 2-space indentation for readability. collect{ name: 'Desk', price: 200 } .toPrettyJson //  '{
  "name": "Desk",
  "price": 200
}' For Compact JSON string, use toJson. For Convert to array/record, use toArray.
